    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 13/10/2025, the use of Flat 4, 89 Princes Avenue, Acton, London, W3 8LY as one self-contained property is lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) for the following reason:\r\nThe evidence provided is sufficient to prove on the balance of probability that the use of the land within the red line as one self-contained dwelling has been in existence continuously for more than four years and would therefore be lawful under Section 171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).\r\n"
